Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Palette $000,$FFF,$F00,$0F0,$00F,$FF0,$0FF,$F0F
For I=0 To 7 : Ink I : Bar I*40,0 To I*40+39,99 : Next I
Ink 1 : Text 10,120,"Graphics 2"
Screen Open 1,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 2
Screen Copy 0,0,0,160,100 To 1,10,10
Screen Copy 0,0,0,320,100 To 1,-50,110
Screen Copy 0,100,0,200,50 To 1,250,170,$60
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/graphics2_1.iff"
Cls 0 : Zoom 0,0,0,160,100 To 1,0,0,64,40 : Zoom 0,0,0,40,100 To 1,100,0,300,180
Zoom 0,0,0,40,100 To 1,100,0,50,180
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/graphics2_2.iff"
Screen 0 : Get Block 1,0,0,80,40 : Get Block 2,0,0,80,40,1 : Get Cblock 3,40,0,80,40
Screen 1 : Cls 0
Put Block 1 : Put Block 1,100,0 : Put Block 1,200,0,%101 : Put Block 1,0,60,%11,$C0
Put Block 2,100,60 : Hrev Block 1 : Vrev Block 1 : Put Block 1,200,60 : Put Cblock 3,0,120 : Put Cblock 3
Get Block 0,0,0,8,8
Put Block 99
Del Block 1 : Del Block : Del Cblock 3 : Del Cblock
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/graphics2_3.iff"
Double Buffer : Autoback 1 : Cls 0 : Ink 1 : Bar 0,0 To 50,50 : Autoback 2 : Ink 2 : Bar 60,60 To 100,100 : Text 10,150,"autoback"
Screen Swap : Wait Vbl : Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/graphics2_4.iff"
Screen Swap : Wait Vbl : Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/graphics2_5.iff"
Autoback 0 : Dual Playfield 0,1
Dual Priority 1,0
Screen Hide 1 : Screen Show : Screen To Back : Screen To Front 0 : View : Auto View Off : Auto View On
Screen Display 0,130,40,320,200 : Screen Offset 0,10,0 : View
Print #1,X Screen(0);Y Screen(0);X Hard(0);Y Hard(0)
Screen Close 1 : Print #1,Screen
Hslider 10,10 To 200,20,100,10,20 : Vslider 10,30 To 20,190,100,50,10 : Set Slider 1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8
Hslider 10,10 To 5,20,100,10,20
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/graphics2_6.iff"
Print #1,"end"
